WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Prepare the customer data
We use POST /api/v1/customers with name and phone in a valid Saudi number format. The number shown is a training number and no messages are sent to it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Run the request
We send JSON with a training key, and show the server's real response with the customer ID, name and mobile.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Check in Customers
We choose Customers & tags from the sidebar, refresh the page to fetch the latest data, then search for the name “API test customer” to check that the record was really added to the training account.
